  "content": "![Logo](https://github.com/MaliceZed/frequency-create/raw/NeoForge-1.21.1/docs/text_logo.png)\n<br>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/frequency-create\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MaliceZed/frequency-create/raw/NeoForge-1.21.1/docs/modrinth.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n\t<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frequency-create\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MaliceZed/frequency-create/raw/NeoForge-1.21.1/docs/curseforge.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n\t<a href=\"https://github.com/MaliceZed/frequency-create\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MaliceZed/frequency-create/raw/NeoForge-1.21.1/docs/github.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n</p>\n<img src=\"https://github.com/MaliceZed/frequency-create/raw/NeoForge-1.21.1/docs/divider.png\" alt=\"Divider\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 10px 0px\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/MaliceZed/frequency-create/raw/NeoForge-1.21.1/docs/about.png\" alt=\"About\" style=\"margin: 5px 10px;\">\n\n***Frequency Create*** 是《Create》模组的一款生活品質增強型附加組件，提供一組符號物品用於配置紅石連結頻率。\n\n<img src=\"https://github.com/MaliceZed/frequency-create/raw/NeoForge-1.21.1/docs/divider.png\" alt=\"Divider\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 10px 0px\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/MaliceZed/frequency-create/raw/NeoForge-1.21.1/docs/features.png\" alt=\"Features\" style=\"margin: 5px 10px\">\n\n此模组新增 **3 組共 78 個符號**：\n- **10 種數字符號**\n- **52 種字母符號**\n- **8 種箭頭符號**\n- **2 種自訂符號**\n- **液體符號**\n- **空符號**\n\n---\n<details><summary>使用滑鼠右鍵點擊符號可開啟圖形介面進行更改：</summary>\n<p align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MaliceZed/frequency-create/raw/NeoForge-1.21.1/docs/gui.png\" alt=\"Swap GUI\" style=\"margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px\"></p>\n</details>\n\n---\n\n<img src=\"https://github.com/MaliceZed/frequency-create/raw/NeoForge-1.21.1/docs/logic_combinator.png\" width=\"150px\"><b>邏輯組合器</b><br>\n允許對信號執行邏輯運算，並將結果輸出至另一頻率。\n\n<img src=\"https://github.com/MaliceZed/frequency-create/raw/NeoForge-1.21.1/docs/divider.png\" alt=\"Divider\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px 0px\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/MaliceZed/frequency-create/raw/NeoForge-1.21.1/docs/support.png\" alt=\"Support\" style=\"margin: 5px 10px\">\n\n發現了 ***錯誤*** 或有 ***建議***？請[回報問題](https://github.com/MaliceZed/frequency-create/issues)！",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
